    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/c11f166a83352fd2a6187f851a7ff77f.avif?t=1755345437\" data-has-big width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Red Reef, where sunlight, sand, and paradise are overshadowed by deception and intrigue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the locals. Reconnect with people from your past and get to know the newcomers who settled on the reef during your absence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/e2ef6a64e7d110d78c5258b6836c28bc.poster.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/e2ef6a64e7d110d78c5258b6836c28bc.webm?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/e2ef6a64e7d110d78c5258b6836c28bc.mp4?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your sexy, yet intimidating co-worker Naomi to gain the signatures needed for your resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/a94a8266b0796c2ab569d3244cb0b105.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liaise with Summer, your childhood best friend-turned-sheriff to solve the murder you and your company are being accused of. OR you could work with Lilith to focus on the strange occult situation tied to the island's ancient past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/4bbe2910157a45ab269b0384a7bd6bfd.poster.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/4bbe2910157a45ab269b0384a7bd6bfd.webm?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/4bbe2910157a45ab269b0384a7bd6bfd.mp4?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with the local merchants, business owners and residents to convince them to sign on your resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/2e93131dea971f9fa5fffb4efb694390.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with other newcomers to the reef who are quite keen to get to know you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/3629b29186a9dabe987803be2f46b8d3.poster.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/3629b29186a9dabe987803be2f46b8d3.webm?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/3629b29186a9dabe987803be2f46b8d3.mp4?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most important of all, dig deep with Evelyn and Julie, the most important women you left behind, to heal the wounds of the past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's also this guy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/5f64ceff1321dc005e792e2287b583b7.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hang out with him too, or not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you decide to play, Lust Bound has you covered. Whether you want to play the romantic, looking for love with that special someone, a seductive playboy, wanting to indulge in ALL that the island has to offer... Lust Bound's stat system and branching narrative lets you craft the experience and characters YOUR way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to embark on a story-rich, new adventure from the studio that brought you Lust Theory and Summer with Mia to see if you can navigate the drama, perils and intrigue waiting for you on Red Reef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/8cce8cceafa7bace6def9fd31cbb9bba.poster.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/8cce8cceafa7bace6def9fd31cbb9bba.webm?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/8cce8cceafa7bace6def9fd31cbb9bba.mp4?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for ADULTS only and it includes explicit, sexual content that some viewers may find offensive. The characters shown in the game are all over 18 years old.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/c11f166a83352fd2a6187f851a7ff77f.avif?t=1755345437\" data-has-big width=800 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Red Reef, where sunlight, sand, and paradise are overshadowed by deception and intrigue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the locals. Reconnect with people from your past and get to know the newcomers who settled on the reef during your absence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/e2ef6a64e7d110d78c5258b6836c28bc.poster.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/e2ef6a64e7d110d78c5258b6836c28bc.webm?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/e2ef6a64e7d110d78c5258b6836c28bc.mp4?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your sexy, yet intimidating co-worker Naomi to gain the signatures needed for your resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/a94a8266b0796c2ab569d3244cb0b105.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liaise with Summer, your childhood best friend-turned-sheriff to solve the murder you and your company are being accused of. OR you could work with Lilith to focus on the strange occult situation tied to the island's ancient past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sha