ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/5f64ceff1321dc005e792e2287b583b7.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hang out with him too, or not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you decide to play, Lust Bound has you covered. Whether you want to play the romantic, looking for love with that special someone, a seductive playboy, wanting to indulge in ALL that the island has to offer... Lust Bound's stat system and branching narrative lets you craft the experience and characters YOUR way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to embark on a story-rich, new adventure from the studio that brought you Lust Theory and Summer with Mia to see if you can navigate the drama, perils and intrigue waiting for you on Red Reef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/8cce8cceafa7bace6def9fd31cbb9bba.poster.avif?t=1755345437\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/8cce8cceafa7bace6def9fd31cbb9bba.webm?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804900/extras/8cce8cceafa7bace6def9fd31cbb9bba.mp4?t=1755345437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for ADULTS only and it includes explicit, sexual content that some viewers may find offensive. The characters shown in the game are all over 18 years old.</p>",
